{
  "title": "Trance Gate",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Tempo-locked step",
        "gate with a per-step",
        "ADSR.",
        "",
        "The ring is the",
        "pattern. Filled arcs",
        "are steps that",
        "sound, hollow ones",
        "are gaps.",
        "",
        "Thickness is the",
        "step's Amount.",
        "",
        "A dot inside the",
        "ring is the",
        "playhead. A bracket",
        "outside it is the",
        "step you are",
        "editing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pads",
      "lines": [
        "One pad per step,",
        "from the bottom",
        "left.",
        "",
        "Green: the step",
        " sounds.",
        "Red: it is a gap.",
        "Bright: the step you",
        " are editing.",
        "Dark: past the end",
        " of the pattern.",
        "",
        "A press toggles the",
        "step AND selects it,",
        "so the knobs edit",
        "what you just hit."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Controls",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Gate Page",
          "lines": [
            "Knob 1: Step",
            " Moves the bracket.",
            "",
            "Knob 2: Gate",
            " Off, On or Tie.",
            " A Tie holds through",
            " the next step",
            " without a",
            " retrigger.",
            "",
            "Knob 3: Amount",
            " How far THIS step",
            " closes the gate.",
            "",
            "Knob 4: Rnd",
            " Click to generate",
            " a new pattern.",
            "",
            "Knob 5: Len",
            "Knob 6: Rate"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Settings Page",
          "lines": [
            "Attack, Decay,",
            "Sustain, Release",
            "shape every step.",
            "",
            "Amount scales the",
            "whole sequence. It",
            "is the same quantity",
            "as the per-step",
            "Amount, one scope",
            "up.",
            "",
            "Slot picks one of 8",
            "patterns.",
            "",
            "Stop says what",
            "happens with no",
            "transport. Open",
            "holds the gate open,",
            "Free keeps running",
            "at the last tempo."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Timing",
      "lines": [
        "The gate follows",
        "song position, so",
        "it stays bar-aligned",
        "however long it runs",
        "and survives a seek.",
        "",
        "Rate is one step's",
        "length. At 1/16 a",
        "16-step pattern is",
        "one bar.",
        "",
        "Times are in ms and",
        "are NOT synced: a",
        "1/16 step is",
        "15000/BPM ms, so 125",
        "ms at 120. Keep",
        "Attack plus Decay",
        "under that or a step",
        "never reaches full."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
